  "result": "I fixed the cross-tenant lookup in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. `findIssueById` now filters on both the issue id and the org id, so an issue from another organization returns `null` and the caller treats it as not found.\n\nThe cause was that `findIssueById(orgId, issueId)` accepted `orgId` but never used it in the query. `getIssue`, the `/api/issues/[issueId]` route, and several services (comments, attachments, search, notifications) all depend on this lookup. Any of them returned another org's issue when given its id.\n\nI did not run the test suite. The existing tests in `tests/repositories/issue-repository.test.ts` and `tests/server/tenant-scope.test.ts` already expect this behavior and should pass with the change.",
